4.1 Project Outcomes
The project successfully achieved most of its planned objectives.
The major achievements included:
•	Construction and successful utilization of a climate-smart poultry house.
•	Procurement and successful brooding of 60 improved Kienyeji chicks.
•	Proper implementation of the feeding programme.
•	Successful vaccination and disease control programme.
•	Proper record keeping.
•	Marketing of mature birds.
•	Acquisition of practical poultry management skills by Form Four candidates.
•	Increased awareness of climate-smart livestock production.
